#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541580"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF's… #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's lips curl into a smile."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "542932"
msgid "And so:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543008"
msgid "…the battle concludes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543232"
msgid "I meet #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's sarcasm with a bit of my own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543392"
msgid "Job's done now, and so is our contract."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543724"
msgid "I couldn't bring myself to ask #C236196003Lancer#CDEF what would become of her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544124"
msgid "Venus, hear me? Earth's top 100 chart is\nold news. It's all about the galactic charts\nthese days, galactic!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544272"
msgid "Once a fool, always a fool.\nIf I want to become a real idol,\nI have to make a fresh, new start."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544536"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF disappears, never looking back once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544844"
msgid "\n…and so, my final quest ends."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544904"
msgid "Through #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's help, our one-time enemy,\n    we gained a way to contest #C236196003BB#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

